{"root":"keren","ipa":"/kərən/","core":"形容词，意为“帅气的、酷的、时髦的、出色的”。常用于日常口语中，形容人很有魅力、穿着时髦，或者某事非常精彩、棒极了。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/kərən/","zh":"帅气的、酷的、时髦的、出色的","phrases":[{"t":"sangat keren","zh":"非常酷"},{"t":"mobil keren","zh":"酷炫的汽车"},{"t":"penampilan keren","zh":"出色的表现"}],"examples":[{"t":"Jaket baru yang kamu pakai sangat keren.","zh":"你穿的新夹克非常酷。"},{"t":"Pertunjukan tadi malam benar-benar keren.","zh":"昨晚的演出真是棒极了。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"keren","ipa":"/kərən/","zh":"帅气的、酷的","phrase":{"t":"paling keren","zh":"最酷的"},"example":{"t":"Dia adalah anak yang paling keren di sekolah.","zh":"他是学校里最酷的孩子。"}},{"w":"kekerenan","ipa":"/kərənɛnan/","zh":"酷劲、过度自信的炫耀","phrase":{"t":"menunjukkan kekerenan","zh":"炫耀酷劲"},"example":{"t":"Jangan terlalu menonjolkan kekerenanmu.","zh":"不要过分炫耀你的酷劲。"}},{"w":"mengerenkan","ipa":"/məŋərɛnkan/","zh":"使显得酷、使变得帅气","phrase":{"t":"mengerenkan gaya","zh":"使风格变得更酷"},"example":{"t":"Dia mencoba mengerenkan gaya rambutnya.","zh":"他试图让自己的发型看起来更酷。"}}],"derSlugs":["keren","kekerenan","mengerenkan"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:56:42.601Z","src":"base"}